              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دخن — dakhkhana — \"to smoke tobacco\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لا يدخن أبي في البيت. lā yudakhkhinu abī fī al-bayt. My father does not smoke at home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يدخن, yudakhkhin."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun تدخين is smoking."
